', null, 'Gravity is the attraction between masses; the Earth pulls objects toward its centre.', '{"blanks":[{"id":"b1","type":"text","label":"force","maxLength":12}],"template":"The force that pulls objects toward the Earth is called ___.","schemaVersion":"1.0"}', '{"answers":[{"type":"text","blankId":"b1","accepted":["gravity"]}]}', '[{"text":"It is why objects fall downward.","level":1}]', ARRAY['topic:physics','subtopic:forces-motion'], 7, 9, 1, 100, null, 'published', false, 1, '2026-08-17 21:19:11.036+00', '2026-08-17 21:26:58.758+00', '{"review":{"note":"Batch 1 content-bank question approved","state":"approved","version":1,"reviewedAt":"2026-08-17T21:26:58.272Z","submittedAt":"2026-08-17T21:26:57.736Z","reviewerAdminId":"a051d17f-a273-4ffb-b79f-b1bc435322c6","submittedByAdminId":"ed8843ee-f598-4966-aae1-f5ebf481af58"},"feedback":{"correct":"Correct — the explanation above shows why.","incorrect":"Not quite. Read the explanation below and try again."},"authoring":{"authorType":"import","contentHash":"3b9d3859cf129a72cf9a1a0234b4932b7269462393ca7fc747237bede93c7f06","authorSource":"stem-quest-task-5.14-batch-1-science","createdByAdminId":"ed8843ee-f598-4966-aae1-f5ebf481af58"},"objective":"Name the force pulling objects to Earth."}'), (386, 1, 3, 5, 'A material that allows most light to pass through is called ___.', null, 'Transparent materials let most light through, so you can see through them clearly.', '{"blanks":[{"id":"b1","type":"text","label":"material type","maxLength":16}],"template":"A material that allows most light to pass through is called ___.","schemaVersion":"1.0"}', '{"answers":[{"type":"text","blankId":"b1","accepted":["transparent"]}]}', '[{"text":"Glass is a good example.","level":1}]', ARRAY['topic:physics','subtopic:waves-light-sound'], 7, 9, 2, 100, null, 'published', false, 1, '2026-08-17 21:19:11.633+00', '2026-08-17 21:27:00.209+00', '{"review":{"note":"Batch 1 content-bank question approved","state":"approved","version":1,"reviewedA