eeps the robot on the table.', null, 'An ultrasonic sensor sends sound and measures the echo, detecting the edge before the robot falls.', '{"decisions":[{"id":"d1","text":"Which sensor should you add?","options":[{"id":"opt_ultra","text":"An ultrasonic distance sensor","outcomeText":"Ultrasonic sensors measure distance ahead — ideal for stopping at the edge.","nextDecision":null},{"id":"opt_light","text":"A light sensor","outcomeText":"A light sensor does not reliably detect a table edge.","nextDecision":null},{"id":"opt_mic","text":"A microphone","outcomeText":"A microphone cannot sense edges.","nextDecision":null}]}],"scenarioText":"You are programming a robot that must stop before it falls off the edge of a table.","entryDecision":"d1","schemaVersion":"1.0"}', '{"optimalPath":[{"optionId":"opt_ultra","decisionId":"d1"}]}', '[{"text":"The sensor should measure how far away the floor is.","level":1}]', ARRAY['topic:electronics-circuits','subtopic:sensors-actuators'], 8, 11, 3, 100, null, 'published', false, 1, '2026-08-17 21:19:39.443+00', '2026-08-17 21:28:01.124+00', '{"review":{"note":"Batch 1 content-bank question approved","state":"approved","version":1,"reviewedAt":"2026-08-17T21:28:00.616Z","submittedAt":"2026-08-17T21:28:00.114Z","reviewerAdminId":"a051d17f-a273-4ffb-b79f-b1bc435322c6","submittedByAdminId":"ed8843ee-f598-4966-aae1-f5ebf481af58"},"feedback":{"correct":"Correct — the explanation above shows why.","incorrect":"Not quite. Read the explanation below and try again."},"authoring":{"authorType":"import","contentHash":"6460a8fb68ac977c19c7b2f627e44cf08dce195372b0fbd0e480be016c80d2f9","authorSource":"stem-quest-task-5.14-batch-1-engineering","createdByAdminId":"ed8843ee-f598-4966-aae1-f5ebf481af58"},"objective":"Choose a sensor for edge detection."}'), (613, 3, 12, 6, 'The diagram shows a lever. Tap the fulcrum.', null, 'The fulcrum is the pivot point on which the lever turns.', '{"mode":"tap","image":{"alt":"Diagram of a seesaw lever with a triangl